{"schemaVersion":1,"id":39,"sections":[{"id":"115004-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[1300],"start":0,"count":18},{"id":"115004-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[11290],"start":18,"count":9},{"id":"115005-PROLOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战前","scripts":[1310],"start":27,"count":11},{"id":"115005-EPILOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战后","scripts":[11300],"start":38,"count":12},{"id":"115006-PROLOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战前","scripts":[1320],"start":50,"count":19},{"id":"115006-EPILOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战后","scripts":[11310],"start":69,"count":15}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"115004-PROLOGUE:1300:2","scriptId":1300,"text":"经过一番折腾，终于把事情的来龙去脉完整得传达给了利爪小队的成员。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"115004-PROLOGUE:1300:3","scriptId":1300,"text":"利爪小队也将自己这边的情况反馈给了我们。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115004-PROLOGUE:1300:4","scriptId":1300,"text":"“整个研究所的兵力几乎被同时调离，并且在这期间敌人还发动了闪电般的突袭，怎么想都觉得太巧了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115004-PROLOGUE:1300:5","scriptId":1300,"text":"“确实比较蹊跷，特别是那些两个不明人形的出现……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115004-PROLOGUE:1300:6","scriptId":1300,"text":"“从雷思丽这边的情报来看，周边地区确实有遭受到战车兽袭击的突发事件，从研究所派一些钢舞姬去支援也无可厚非。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":103,"right":211,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115004-PROLOGUE:1300:7","scriptId":1300,"text":"“作为一个正常的指挥，你觉得会把所有兵力都派出去支援而不留一些防守吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":103,"right":211,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115004-PROLOGUE:1300:8","scriptId":1300,"text":"“而且从目前得到的信息来看，并不是研究所直接发出的调度命令，这点很可疑。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":41,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115004-PROLOGUE:1300:9","scriptId":1300,"text":"“就是说上层中出了叛徒？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":41,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115004-PROLOGUE:1300:10","scriptId":1300,"text":"“佐伊，这个可不能乱说，当心被传讯军事法庭说你战时造谣惑众……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":41,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115004-PROLOGUE:1300:11","scriptId":1300,"text":"“诶！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":40,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115004-PROLOGUE:1300:12","scriptId":1300,"text":"“总之这边的情况已经掌握，我会着手调查，奈乐那边私底下报告给隆美尔将军就行了，其他人关于这事情不要声张。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":211,"right":40,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115004-PROLOGUE:1300:13","scriptId":1300,"text":"“那报告和传令就交给教官和奈乐了，我们准备返程吧，反正代步工具也到手了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":40,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"115004-PROLOGUE:1300:14","scriptId":1300,"text":"谢天谢地，在这个中继站的车库里还是有一辆可以发动的老式摩托。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":40,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":440,"speaker":"瓦什蒂·布雷德利","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115004-PROLOGUE:1300:15","scriptId":1300,"text":"“研究所既然已经没了，那我们只能先回胜利女神特勤局总部报告情况了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":440,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115004-PROLOGUE:1300:16","scriptId":1300,"text":"“那么也应该顺路，跟我们一起行动吧，可以更安全点。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":440,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":448,"speaker":"瓦什蒂·布雷德利","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115004-PROLOGUE:1300:17","scriptId":1300,"text":"“好啊！好啊！就这样吧～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":448,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":460,"speaker":"雷思丽·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115004-PROLOGUE:1300:18","scriptId":1300,"text":"“队长那家伙一听到可以偷懒就立刻有精神了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":460,"right":448,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":475,"speaker":"达克妮·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115004-PROLOGUE:1300:19","scriptId":1300,"text":"“还好吧，同行有个照应，至少不用担心战斗力不足了～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":460,"right":475,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"115004-EPILOGUE:11290:1","scriptId":11290,"text":"返程的路途上遇到了不少战车兽，不过因为利爪小队的加入，扫除障碍根本不成问题。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":460,"right":475,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115004-EPILOGUE:11290:2","scriptId":11290,"text":"（恩，利爪小队的队员战斗水准都很高，除了瓦什蒂队长以外……）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":475,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115004-EPILOGUE:11290:3","scriptId":11290,"text":"（能干的队员加上无能的队长吗……）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":475,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":31,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115004-EPILOGUE:11290:4","scriptId":11290,"text":"“长官，从刚才开始就看到你一直盯着瓦什蒂在看？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":31,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":87,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115004-EPILOGUE:11290:5","scriptId":11290,"text":"“哼哼～肯定是在看那个啦～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":87,"right":31,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":41,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115004-EPILOGUE:11290:6","scriptId":11290,"text":"“那个？那个是什么？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":87,"right":41,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":87,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115004-EPILOGUE:11290:7","scriptId":11290,"text":"“胸部啦！胸部！肯定是在看瓦什蒂的大胸啦！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":87,"right":41,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115004-EPILOGUE:11290:8","scriptId":11290,"text":"“噫……长官这个大色鬼！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":87,"right":40,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115004-EPILOGUE:11290:9","scriptId":11290,"text":"“……我一个字都还没说呢，怎么就成色鬼了？？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":40,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":460,"speaker":"雷思丽·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115005-PROLOGUE:1310:2","scriptId":1310,"text":"“这一路上的战车兽很少啊，而且能看到不少尸体。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":460,"right":40,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115005-PROLOGUE:1310:3","scriptId":1310,"text":"“没错，毕竟现在是按原路返回，之前已经清理掉很多战车兽了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":460,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":460,"speaker":"雷思丽·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115005-PROLOGUE:1310:4","scriptId":1310,"text":"“哇，你们真是好厉害！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":460,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":35,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115005-PROLOGUE:1310:5","scriptId":1310,"text":"“啊哈哈哈，哪里，哪里～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":460,"right":35,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":81,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115005-PROLOGUE:1310:6","scriptId":1310,"text":"“大部分的功劳其实都是教官的吧……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":81,"right":35,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115005-PROLOGUE:1310:7","scriptId":1310,"text":"“这你们就谦虚了，侦察和诱敌都是十分重要的工作。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":81,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":89,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115005-PROLOGUE:1310:8","scriptId":1310,"text":"“哈哈，这么一说好像也对。长官真是明智，我负责侦察，佐伊负责诱敌～分工明确。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":89,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115005-PROLOGUE:1310:9","scriptId":1310,"text":"“呜……我才不是诱敌，我可是冲锋陷阵去的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":89,"right":40,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115005-PROLOGUE:1310:10","scriptId":1310,"text":"“冲过去，然后就躲到掩体后面，等我们火力援护，这种行为就叫做诱敌……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":103,"right":40,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":40,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115005-PROLOGUE:1310:11","scriptId":1310,"text":"“呃……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":103,"right":40,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":89,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115005-PROLOGUE:1310:12","scriptId":1310,"text":"“哈哈哈哈，笨蛋佐伊果然不是白叫的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":89,"right":40,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"115005-EPILOGUE:11300:1","scriptId":11300,"text":"由于是按原路返回，所以途经了全毁的马奇诺研究所……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":89,"right":40,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":460,"speaker":"雷思丽·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115005-EPILOGUE:11300:2","scriptId":11300,"text":"“哇……真是被炸平了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":460,"right":40,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115005-EPILOGUE:11300:3","scriptId":11300,"text":"“自毁程序的威力真是巨大，光凭战车兽的那些炮火是不足以达到全毁研究所的程度。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":460,"right":103,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":445,"speaker":"瓦什蒂·布雷德利","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115005-EPILOGUE:11300:4","scriptId":11300,"text":"“但是自毁程序不是说启动就能启动的，启动程序的代码应该是最高机密。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":445,"right":103,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":216,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115005-EPILOGUE:11300:5","scriptId":11300,"text":"“这也是让人奇怪的地方，那两个不明人形到底是何方神圣，竟然能启动自毁程序。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":445,"right":216,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":465,"speaker":"雷思丽·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115005-EPILOGUE:11300:6","scriptId":11300,"text":"“不过失去了研究所我们该何去何从呢……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":465,"right":216,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":475,"speaker":"达克妮·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115005-EPILOGUE:11300:7","scriptId":11300,"text":"“气氛不要那么沉重啦，就报给胜利女神特勤局来解决吧。何去何从这种事情也轮不到我们想，服从组织安排就行了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":465,"right":475,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":460,"speaker":"雷思丽·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115005-EPILOGUE:11300:8","scriptId":11300,"text":"“没心没肺的野猫，你也好歹在那个研究所工作过！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":460,"right":475,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":475,"speaker":"达克妮·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115005-EPILOGUE:11300:9","scriptId":11300,"text":"“都发生了，在那里闷闷不乐也不能解决什么。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":460,"right":475,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":460,"speaker":"雷思丽·戴维斯","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115005-EPILOGUE:11300:10","scriptId":11300,"text":"“哼！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":460,"right":475,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115005-EPILOGUE:11300:11","scriptId":11300,"text":"（我倒是也比较同意达克妮的观点……）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":460,"right":3,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115005-EPILOGUE:11300:12","scriptId":11300,"text":"“那么，继续前进吧，赶路要紧。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":460,"right":3,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"115006-PROLOGUE:1320:2","scriptId":1320,"text":"地点----？？？","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":460,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"115006-PROLOGUE:1320:3","scriptId":1320,"text":"一个宽敞的房间，一副巨大的人工水槽前，奥米克戎和兰布达两个人正在说着些什么。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":460,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":421,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"115006-PROLOGUE:1320:4","scriptId":1320,"text":"“那么研究成果怎么样了？兰布达。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":421,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"115006-PROLOGUE:1320:5","scriptId":1320,"text":"“目前来说融合还是比较成功的，不过还需要观察一段时间，量产的路还远着呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":421,"right":56,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"115006-PROLOGUE:1320:6","scriptId":1320,"text":"看了看水槽中正在上下浮动的人形生物，奥米克戎微微一笑。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":421,"right":56,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":421,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"115006-PROLOGUE:1320:7","scriptId":1320,"text":"“不错不错，虽然形状上面还不稳定，不过既然你这么说了，那我就安心等结果了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":421,"right":56,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"115006-PROLOGUE:1320:8","scriptId":1320,"text":"“不会有任何差池的。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":421,"right":56,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":421,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"115006-PROLOGUE:1320:9","scriptId":1320,"text":"“但是我有一点很不满啊，为什么要放跑那些钢舞姬？”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":421,"right":56,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"115006-PROLOGUE:1320:10","scriptId":1320,"text":"“……！！？？”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":421,"right":56,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"115006-PROLOGUE:1320:11","scriptId":1320,"text":"“你在监视我？？”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":421,"right":56,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":421,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"115006-PROLOGUE:1320:12","scriptId":1320,"text":"“那倒不是，要知道埃普西隆可是个麻烦鬼，多一只眼睛看着总是好的嘛。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":421,"right":56,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":421,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"115006-PROLOGUE:1320:13","scriptId":1320,"text":"“那么回答一下我的问题吧，反正这里也没其他人。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":421,"right":56,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"115006-PROLOGUE:1320:14","scriptId":1320,"text":"“那群钢舞姬身上带着我之前留下的样本物质，因为当时已经开始有坏死的迹象我就扔了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":421,"right":56,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":421,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"115006-PROLOGUE:1320:15","scriptId":1320,"text":"“那现在呢？他们拿着一个坏死的样本又能怎么样。”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":421,"right":56,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"115006-PROLOGUE:1320:16","scriptId":1320,"text":"“那个样本物质好像活了下来……”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":421,"right":56,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":420,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"115006-PROLOGUE:1320:17","scriptId":1320,"text":"“什么！！？？那还不快去把它回收了？？”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":420,"right":56,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"115006-PROLOGUE:1320:18","scriptId":1320,"text":"“因为好奇，所以我就没有杀她们……想看看之后会怎么样……”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":420,"right":56,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":420,"speaker":"奥米克戎","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"115006-PROLOGUE:1320:19","scriptId":1320,"text":"“你……你……你可真是坏了我的大事了！”","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":420,"right":56,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"115006-PROLOGUE:1320:20","scriptId":1320,"text":"说罢，奥米克戎带着一脸怒愤快速走出了房间。","background":"/art/stories/zdjm-034.webp","left":420,"right":56,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"115006-EPILOGUE:11310:1","scriptId":11310,"text":"回到主人公一行……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":420,"right":56,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115006-EPILOGUE:11310:2","scriptId":11310,"text":"“终于又看到伏龙芝了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":56,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115006-EPILOGUE:11310:3","scriptId":11310,"text":"“还有一段距离呢，不要放松警惕。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115006-EPILOGUE:11310:4","scriptId":11310,"text":"“是！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115006-EPILOGUE:11310:5","scriptId":11310,"text":"“那个……教官你的裤子湿了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115006-EPILOGUE:11310:6","scriptId":11310,"text":"“！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115006-EPILOGUE:11310:7","scriptId":11310,"text":"“嗯？？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"115006-EPILOGUE:11310:8","scriptId":11310,"text":"看到教官的腰部及以下部位有点湿润的迹象。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115006-EPILOGUE:11310:9","scriptId":11310,"text":"“这……是背包里面漏水了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"115006-EPILOGUE:11310:10","scriptId":11310,"text":"打开背包一看，确实是那个不明物质在不停的往外冒出液体……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115006-EPILOGUE:11310:11","scriptId":11310,"text":"“这活性化速度也太快了！需要马上注水，这附近有没有水源？？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":36,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115006-EPILOGUE:11310:12","scriptId":11310,"text":"“这里最近的就是伏龙芝了……过去还要点距离啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":36,"right":211,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115006-EPILOGUE:11310:13","scriptId":11310,"text":"“用这水壶里的水行不行？反正我也喝不光。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":211,"speaker":"索菲亚·马利诺夫娜","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"115006-EPILOGUE:11310:14","scriptId":11310,"text":"“恩！还是你机灵！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"115006-EPILOGUE:11310:15","scriptId":11310,"text":"索菲亚教官一把拿过水壶，往那不明物质上浇……","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-04.webp","left":3,"right":211,"section":5,"shake":false}],"summaries":["中继站休息中","回程路漫漫，情况也真是层出不穷……","是非曲折"]}
